WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.298
AI Capability Needs a Home. A model can answer a

2
00:00:05.298 --> 00:00:10.595
question. It cannot, by itself, remember why your team made

3
00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:15.893
a decision, which source was trusted, or what a responsible

4
00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:21.191
next step looks like. That is why AI capability needs

5
00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:26.488
a home. The home is not one model or one

6
00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:31.786
vendor. It is the operating environment that retains context, preserves

7
00:00:31.786 --> 00:00:37.084
evidence, assigns ownership, and lets a team work again tomorrow

8
00:00:37.084 --> 00:00:42.381
without starting from zero. Access is not a system. Anyone

9
00:00:42.381 --> 00:00:47.679
can open a powerful tool. The leverage appears when the

10
00:00:47.679 --> 00:00:52.977
same work can be repeated with the same boundaries: source

11
00:00:52.977 --> 00:00:58.275
collection, claim review, human approval, release record, and post-release learning.

12
00:00:58.275 --> 00:01:03.572
What should stay close. Keep durable context close to the

13
00:01:03.572 --> 00:01:08.870
work: editorial standards, evidence records, operating notes, customer boundaries, and

14
00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:14.168
the decisions that explain why a workflow exists. Use external

15
00:01:14.168 --> 00:01:19.465
services selectively when they add a specialized capability or a

16
00:01:19.465 --> 00:01:24.763
